[en.FOCUS_C12_DEEP_IN_THE_MINE]
Expand ThunderMine

[en.FOCUS_C12_DEEP_IN_THE_MINE_desc]
Even though we believe we've taken every precaution, we can never predict the circumstances into which we might fall in the future. Completely safeguarding our ground-based military factories is not as simple as it sounds. To that end, we can carefully select some secret locations and transport our machine tools and equipment deep into the mines. This will ensure that even if enemy airships bomb the surface into a barren wasteland, we will still have the option to mount a desperate last stand.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_DEEP_IN_THE_MINE]
矿洞深处

[zh.FOCUS_C12_DEEP_IN_THE_MINE_desc]
纵然我们以为自身已经做好了万全之计，但我们永远无法预料到我们未来会陷入怎样的处境，想要完全保护好我们地面上的军工厂没有说起来那么容易。为此，我们可以精心挑选一些秘密地点，将机床和设备送入矿洞的深处，这可以确保我们即使被敌军的飞艇轰炸的满地荒芜时仍然有背水一战的选择权。

